    "drives BOTH sides: the v4 oracle (build-tool-execution-fixture.ts +",
    "tool-execution-tier2.ts, driving v4's REAL saveToolMessages) and the Rust",
    "port (quilltap-harness tool_execution tier-2 test, driving save_tool_messages).",
    "",
    "SEED: one chat (a USER participant + a CHARACTER participant, so the whisper",
    "target userParticipantId is a real participant id) and one GENERATED image",
    "file (for the generate_image link+tag case). chat_messages + files tables are",
    "materialized so the Rust port (no DDL) can INSERT.",
    "",
    "CALLS: each is one saveToolMessages invocation. They bank the whisper matrix",
    "(public / ALWAYS_PRIVATE / VAULT_READ x cross-reads both ways), the content",
    "field order + omission (anchorOffset/seq/callId + metadata present vs absent),",
    "a multi-message batch (order + firstToolMessageId), and the generated-image",
    "link+tag+id attachment.",
    "",
    "NORMALIZATION (applied identically both sides): saveToolMessages mints the",
    "TOOL row id (crypto.randomUUID) + createdAt, the chat's lastMessageAt/updatedAt",
    "(a TOOL row is type:'message', so it bumps them), and the file's updatedAt",
    "(addLink/addTag). Minted message ids are remapped to first-seen tokens by a",
    "content-sorted walk (content is pinned + distinct); files.linkedTo + the",
    "returned firstToolMessageId resolve through that shared map. Minted timestamps",
    "are placeholdered (sentinel-aware on chats: a value equal to the seed sentinel",
    "stays pinned). tags = [characterId] is pinned; generatedImageIds = the seeded",
    "file id, pinned."
  ],
